From 3b86411f2eda59df1c3d937ec185d37e1cbd9413 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:25:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash routing through provider command
 APIs to avoid normal sends

Detect slash-prefixed selected-agent messages before the ordinary send path and delegate them to the backend command contract. Codex resolves those commands through app-server command actions on the existing thread while non-command chat still uses normal turns.
